menu "Vibe Wi-Fi fallback"

    config VIBE_WIFI_SSID
        string "Fallback Wi-Fi SSID (leave empty to use saved credentials)"
        default ""
        help
            Used only when no credentials have been saved through vibe_wifi
            and no ESP-IDF STA configuration already exists in Wi-Fi NVS.

    config VIBE_WIFI_PASSWORD
        string "Fallback Wi-Fi password"
        default ""
        help
            Leave empty for an open network. For WPA2/WPA3, use 8 to 63
            characters. This value is stored in local sdkconfig, so keep a
            configured sdkconfig with credentials out of shared repositories.

endmenu
